  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "Sean",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "Captain, the space transition to the second relay@point is complete.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "Energy field deployed in all directions at maximum@output.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "Eun",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "Radar contact!@Object, possibly a battleship, 3 o'clock, depression 5!@One of them, range 2!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "Miles",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "The <Zovorg>?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "Yes, it's a Zeranio-class Carrier!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "Lieutenant Yon's prediction was right again.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "Both last time and now, the timing is too perfect.@Don't you find that strange?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "Are you saying the Lieutenant leaked information?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "It's possible. Calling it a coincidence...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "Hm? They're falling back?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "The enemy didn't deploy mobile weapons beforehand,@nor did they strike first. Perhaps our transition@was unexpected for them too?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "So we ran into each other by chance.@But I don't see why they didn't strike first.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "Commander. May I respond to this?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "I'll leave it to you, but don't pursue too far.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "Understood.@Starboard 90 degrees, prepare for anti-ship combat!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "Kinaha",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "Ngh, we couldn't get away in time...!@And of all things, that barbarian ship@had to transition in here...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "Such a coincidence... What awful luck...!@If things start like this, I'll lose all standing.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "Temporarily release the energy field!@All mobile units, launch at once!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "Bioroid Soldier",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "Warning. Enemy ship deploying mobile units.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "How long until our space transition?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "120 remaining.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "It's unfortunate that they've seen us,@but we'll just have to get away somehow.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "What's with that guy? He's awfully timid.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "If we can avoid fighting,@that'd be for the best, though.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "Lieutenant Yon Jevana is requesting permission@to contact the Zeranio-class.@She wants to question their affiliation.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "Commander, what shall we do?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "...Permission granted, as long as@the communication is open.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "I'll pass that on.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "Report. Incoming transmission from the enemy@on a standard channel.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "Those barbarians. Are they going to demand@our surrender?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "I am Gayattoba Stecca. Aide to Mekibos Borquede,@special envoy of the Zovorg Privy Council.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Military action in the Earth Sphere without@Privy Council permission is forbidden.@State your affiliation, name and rank.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "If there is no reply, we will board and@inspect your vessel by force.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "Ngh, of all people, that woman here...!@Just how bad can my luck get...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "In that case, I can't be picky about my methods.@Launch interceptors. Have them buy time until@this ship can transition.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Warning.@Weapon deliveries to the main force will decrease.@Risk of an information leak.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "They might as well know who we are already.@I'll have no excuse for the young master, but...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "We must avoid the worst case, this ship being@captured, at all costs. Carry out my orders.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "So that's their answer!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Heh, suits me fine.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "...They are almost certainly@agents of the <Golaikunru>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "On what grounds?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "Why they didn't deploy mobile units beforehand,@or launch a first strike right after@the Hiryu Custom transitioned in...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "It's because if it had been a Zovorg ship@appearing here, they couldn't afford@to attack carelessly.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "So they were trying to see who was transitioning in.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Yes.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Us aside, if a Zovorg ship@was coming through, you'd think@they'd know in advance.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "If they were operating with official authorization,@yes. I think they really wanted to leave here@before the Hiryu Custom appeared.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "Then again, even if they couldn't escape,@as long as they took no hostile action,@they could play dumb later...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "So it was lucky for us that they@couldn't launch a first strike.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "And on the flip side, Yon being here@was bad luck for them, huh?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "Most likely.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Either way, now that they've launched interceptors,@we can't ignore them. All units, spread out and@attack. Is that all right, Lieutenant Yon?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "In my position, I'd like to capture@the Zeranio and inspect it... But I can't@be choosy now. Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "...It seems that man isn't here.@That's a blessing in disguise...@I'll get away no matter what.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "Report. Space transition preparations complete.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "Then activate the remaining units'@self-destruct devices, and transition.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "For this time... no, and for last time too,@I will pay you back, Gayattoba Stecca.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "The Zeranio-class has transitioned out!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "Commander. Shall we capture the remaining@enemy units, as Lieutenant Yon wishes?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "This enemy ran away quickly.@They may have booby-trapped@the units they left behind.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "(Oh, a fine deduction.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "We can't afford extra trouble right now.@Eliminate the enemy units quickly.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "S-So much damage in so short a time...!@You're stronger than I expected,@<Steel Dragons>...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "Thicken the barrage!@Hold out until we can transition!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Transition immediately!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "For this time... no, and for last time too,@I will pay you back,@Gayattoba Stecca...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "The Zeranio-class has transitioned.@All enemy signals in the combat area are gone.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "To push in on us so quickly...!@The <Steel Dragons> truly aren't to be underestimated...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "Ngh, things are starting to look bad...!@If worst comes to worst, I'll escape in the Org-Valu.@Prepare the space transition device.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "Th-This can't... This is the worst,@the absolute worst!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Activate the remaining units' self-destruct devices!@Transition my unit! Hurry!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "The Zeranio-class has been sunk!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "Shall we capture the remaining enemy units,@as Lieutenant Yon wishes?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "No, the units they left behind@may be booby-trapped.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "We can't afford extra trouble here.@Eliminate the enemy units quickly.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "Transition my unit! Hurry!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "The Zeranio-class has been sunk!@All enemy signals in the combat area are gone!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "All enemy signals in the area are gone.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "All engines stop.@Maintain strict all-around vigilance and recalculate@our course. Recover all units for repairs and resupply.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "Hiryu Custom Hangar",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Just like Yon predicted,@we ran right into the enemy.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "I wonder what they were doing there...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "Hmm, weren't they meeting up with someone?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "If that bunch was some kind of supply unit,@we'd better assume the <Golaikunru> are@ramping up to full-scale military action.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "Not just them. The remnants@of the <Gaia Savers> showed up too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "And in Canis, too... During <The Sealing War>,@those were piloted by the <Machinery Children>,@weren't they?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "Yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "Egret Fehu, who created them, fell in the final@battle at <Grand Christmas>. So how could they@keep that many of them going?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Maybe they'd been preserved somewhere@in cryogenic sleep.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "Then what about the Canis?@Those take a lot of work to build@and maintain, don't they...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "Tsugumi",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "They were probably stored in some plant@or transport ship, I'd imagine.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "You mean there could be a secret Gaia Savers@base out in space?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "It's only a possibility.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "I don't like this.@They attacked right before our space transition,@like they'd been waiting for it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "Maybe they were monitoring our movements.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "So they're out for revenge on us@for taking down the Gaia Savers?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "They were a persistent bunch, weren't they?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "Tch. The Ares Geist, the Canis, the Golaikunru...@Ghosts of the Sealing War are crawling all over.@It just doesn't sit right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "Same goes for this voyage.@A lot of it doesn't add up.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "I agree, sir.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "Captain Viletta seemed suspicious too...@I wonder if the higher-ups will ever give us@a proper explanation.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "What's wrong, Ing? You look troubled...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "Oh, it's nothing...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "(Were those Canis pilots really@Machinery Children...?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "Hiryu Custom - Fleet Commander's Office",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "Bryan",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "Encounter battles right before and right after@a space transition. What an eventful voyage.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "My apologies, Your Excellency.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "Well, I suppose that's just like the Steel Dragons.@As long as it doesn't delay our schedule.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "That won't be a problem.@From our current position, we can reach@Rabulpaila in two days of normal cruising.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "Hmm, two days...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "Is something troubling you, sir?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "Yes, I was just thinking that Rabulpaila's orbit@is awfully close to the Zovorg Transition Route.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "Indeed...@In outer space, a distance you can cover in@two days is practically within earshot.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "Would the Golaikunru really overlook@something so close by?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "...If you're right, sir, I don't think they@would have contacted us by such means@in the first place.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "True. Let's hope it's just needless worry...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}